 "notes": "Scraped 2026-10-27 from the dpi_gis parish map at cdow.org/find-a-parish/ (79 parish entries; the same page carries 33 schools and 4 jobs, skipped) by scratch/wilmington-map-1/tools/cdow_finder.py. Lists churches, not parishes: missions are entries of their own. id is the plugin's post id. mass_times decodes the map's data-mass-times (day 0=Sun). The map's own deanery ids are all 0, so deanery and deanery_parish are joined from cdow.org/deaneries/ (56 parishes in six deaneries) by name and town: all 56 match; 59 entries get a deanery (both churches of the St. Mary & Holy Savior and St. Michael/Mary Mother of Peace parishes, and both St. Francis de Sales entries); the 20 without are 17 missions, the two Ukrainian churches and the Dover AFB chapel. Several names carry their parish ('Holy Redeemer. St. Francis de Sales & Holy Redeemer Parish'). St. Francis de Sales, Salisbury appears twice (184: 413 Wicomico St, no Masses; 175: 535 Riverside Dr). Websites as listed: Holy Cross, Dover's is a spam page (sub.ireland724.info); Middletown's, St. Mary of the IC's and Cambridge's are catholicmasses.org listings, Berlin's a catholicindex.org listing; Corpus Christi's is St. Matthew's site.",
